{
  "id": "poem-4969f991e0fa8177c9d8782c",
  "title": "菩萨蛮 其七",
  "author": "温庭筠",
  "dynasty": "唐",
  "verses": [
    "凤凰相对盘金缕，牡丹一夜经微雨。",
    "明镜照新妆，鬓轻双脸长。",
    "画楼相望久，栏外垂丝柳。",
    "音信不归来，社前双燕回。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "花间集",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/五代诗词/huajianji/huajianji-1-juan.json#record-6",
